		{
			dependencies: ["5865797006BBAAE2"]
			description: [
				"Terra Immundus overhauls Scorched Guns' progression."
				""
				"Raids and blueprints are no longer a thing. Instead, gun progression focuses on materials you 'unlock' as you progress further, as well as the resource costs and types. As such, progression is a bit more loose. "
				""
				"As always, use JEI to see recipes and uses of items."
			]
			id: "56B4243C13CBA71D"
			shape: "hexagon"
			tasks: [{
