			description: [
				"Each weapon type has different attributes:"
				""
				"- Swords have +33% random crit chance."
				""
				"- Greatswords have +5 armor when held."
				""
				"- Rapiers pierce 6 armor, Spears pierce 2."
				""
				"- Maces pierce 25% of armor, Halberds pierce  12.5% of armor."
				"- Hammers deal +25% more crit damage."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"- Glaives give +25% dodge chance when held in each hand, for a total of 50%."
				""
				"- Spears pierce 2 levels of Protection."
				""
				"- Scythes heals the user 5% of the dealt damage."
				""
